87fe56-0e69-4a53-9854-5de0ed4352bd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8287fe56-0e69-4a53-9854-5de0ed4352bd\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/38px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/50px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Triumphs and Travels of Lump the Enlightened\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Day 1: Now that I see truth, I can scarcely remember a time before. At first, I thought it the human's thin flesh that bestowed this gift, but I've come to believe it was the <a href=\"/wiki/Warped_Headband_of_Intellect\" title=\"Warped Headband of Intellect\">circlet</a> she wore. There was crunch in that chew.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Day 4: The goblin boss <a href=\"/wiki/Dror_Ragzlin\" title=\"Dror Ragzlin\">Dror Ragzlin</a> made a tantalising proposal: spare any prey bearing his <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">new god's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">brand</a>, and feast on the rest. He offered considerable coin in return.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1846/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30106/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7845/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932002/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.922      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.922      1 -total\n 57.05%   24.486      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.53%   21.689     19 Template:Trim\n 22.64%    9.717      2 Template:Uid\n 15.36%    6.593      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.75%    6.333      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.18%    5.659      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.05%    4.313      2 Template:CharLink\n  9.89%    4.246      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12625-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214925 and revision id 361599. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}